{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.poster.avif?t=1772697617\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.webm?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/b5474d0c4b151b43b320768c51197ec8.mp4?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique modern tanks with distinct capabilities await\u2014whether for assault, defense, or firepower suppression, find your perfect steel partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/03de2dad9a46ec0231ee75ded6489dc8.avif?t=1772697617\" width=640 height=1412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.poster.avif?t=1772697617\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.webm?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/8897638226cd50af44ef681c536b39bb.mp4?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tank features unique active and passive skills that can be freely combined, enabling distinctive playstyles and infusing battles with strategy and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.poster.avif?t=1772697617\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.webm?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/2ef8d3f9d83446147b50c34d6461726f.mp4?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge into the fray, engage in close-quarters combat\u2014break the traditional stalemate! Fallen in battle? Return to the fight in seconds. Fast-paced, high-intensity\u2014true warriors never yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.poster.avif?t=1772697617\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.webm?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/f423fc08a7a1aa62a73fa5e7bfedfa65.mp4?t=1772697617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing highly authentic military-grade models, we meticulously deconstruct and simulate vehicle performance through advanced algorithms, delivering an ultra-realistic audio-visual experience powered by the Unreal Engine.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027990/extras/e24fbd91eb81e0d7d79517f125df8ff0.poster.